OL,3,GNEWSAPride and relief with South East
OL,4,Astudents' GCSE results
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents across the South East have
OL,7,Fexpressed joy and relief after
OL,8,Freceiving their GCSE and equivalent
OL,9,Fresults.
OL,11,FAt Guildford County School, student
OL,12,FVelissity said she was "super happy"
OL,13,Fafter achieving a grade nine in Maths.
OL,15,FHer friend, Askja, said she was
OL,16,Fplanning to study Sociology, Psychology
OL,17,Fand Textiles for the next stage of her
OL,18,Feducation after getting the grades she
OL,19,Fneeded.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
